desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "scala"
	title: "源码扫描：Scala Play Cookie 关闭 secure"
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Scala Play Cookie 关闭 secure"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-scala-play-cookie"
	risk: "cookie-security"
	cwe: "CWE-614"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
secure = false 的 Play Cookie 会在明文 HTTP 上发送。

该语言还没有 struct/ssa 前端。source 规则用正则扫描源码，builtin verify 会检查内嵌样例。

### 风险类型
cookie-security

### 影响
命中说明文件中出现了该危险写法。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配。
### 参考
- CWE-614
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
设置 secure = true。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.scala": <<<POS
object C { val secure = false }

POS
	"safefile://ok.scala": <<<NEG
object C { val secure = true }

NEG
)
${*.scala}.pattern_regex(/secure\s*=\s*false/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "源码扫描：Scala Play Cookie 关闭 secure",
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Scala Play Cookie 关闭 secure",
	message: "源码扫描：Scala Play Cookie 关闭 secure",
	risk: "cookie-security",
}
